Unslop includes an original digest of editorial rules from the Google
developer documentation style guide:

https://developers.google.com/style

That guide is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not
affiliated with Google.

The runtime contract is the local files in skill/unslop/. Agents must not
fetch the public guide as a step.

House rule that differs from Google: do not emit em dashes or en dashes
in agent output. Recast or use a hyphen-minus.
